-        // The link under the pointer - the only way an embedder learns there
-        // is one, because ghostty owns link detection (its `link-url` regex and
-        // OSC 8) and draws the highlight itself. An empty URL means the pointer
-        // left the link. Reported only when the highlight changes, so this is
-        // not a per-move event.
